# Keep the simulation build context limited to the package, native deployment
# tree, robot meshes, and bundled third-party/native dependencies. This image
# needs those assets even though generated reports and model files are mounted
# at runtime.
**
!gear_sonic/
!gear_sonic/**
!gear_sonic_deploy/
!gear_sonic_deploy/**
!external_dependencies/
!external_dependencies/unitree_sdk2_python/
!external_dependencies/unitree_sdk2_python/**
# Exclude generated content inside the otherwise included source trees.
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/build
**/target
**/outputs
**/logs
**/.venv*
**/*.onnx
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.ckpt
**/*.safetensors
**/*.engine
